        "active_waves",
        "in_flight_groups",
        "instruction_histogram",
        "vector_load_bits",
        "per_kernel_timing_of_llama_cpp"
      ],
      "known_blind_spots": [
        "Dispatch timing covers BoltBeam's own kernels only; llama.cpp's per-kernel time needs Instruments.",
        "The command-buffer GPU interval includes a fixed start cost, reported as dispatch_floor_us and not subtracted.",
        "Hardware counters, registers and the compiled ISA are not exposed by Metal without Instruments; those probe fields stay absent."
      ],
      "calibration_notes": [
        "Every timed probe sample follows a 64 MiB flush, so weights come from DRAM.",
        "Each probe output is checked against a pure-Python dequantize-and-dot reference before timing.",
        "Whole-step tokens per second is llama-bench decode at the requested depth; nothing else stands in for it."
      ]
    },
